            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>This dataset includes O, O2, and N2 number densities in the altitude region from 110.1 km to 667.5 km derived from TIMED/GUVI limb observation and the corresponding WACCM-X simulated ones. These data are daily average values in five latitude bins from 50 degree south to 50 degree north with a bin size of 20 degrees, and number of data points and observing local times for the data in the latitude bins. They are used to make Figures 1-10 in the paper with the title the same as the title for this dataset.</gco:CharacterString>
            </gmd:abstract>

